<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia peso dips to 1,114.70 against dollar.</title>
<headline>Colombia peso dips to 1,114.70 against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's peso closed down a wafer- thin 30 centavos to 1,114.70, interbank dealers said.</p>
<p>There was quite a lot of speculation pushing the peso down early on in the session then there was sudden influx of $25 million which left many banks with long positions.</p>
<p>Dealers reported 351 trades worth $170 million. The peso opened at 1,116 and traded between an intraday high of 1,113.80 and a low of 1,117.15</p>
<p>((-- Nelson Bocanegra, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
